msgid "Wait- That was you two? Wow. You saved my synthetic bacon with that. Those two enforcers seemed like they were looking for trouble."
msgstr "Warte- das wart ihr zwei? Wow. Ihr habt mir damit meinen synthetischen Arsch gerettet. Die zwei Vollstrecker sahen aus, als suchten sie Ärger."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wait-... you want me to-"
msgstr "Warte-... du willst, dass ich-"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Wait. It like, stops the itch? For good?"
msgstr "Warte. Es stoppt sozusagen das Jucken? Für immer?"

